{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24374","headline":"喜小楼西新柳抽条 · 白居易","name":"喜小楼西新柳抽条","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一行弱柳前年种，数尺柔条今日新。\n渐欲拂他骑马客，未多遮得上楼人。\n须教碧玉羞眉黛，莫与红桃作麴尘。\n爲报金堤千万树，饶伊未敢苦争春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24374.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24374","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}